{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 1, "text": "The ring!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 2, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 3, "text": "// Answer 1 (Where have you been all this time?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 4, "text": "I've been searching for a way to get you to the Core."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 5, "text": "All in one piece, that is."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 6, "text": "That was the plan all along, right?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 7, "text": "On top of that, I had to avoid running into"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 8, "text": "Crazy Mita, you know?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 9, "text": "I also had to dig up any info I could"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 10, "text": "about this goddamn universe's backend, you realize?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 11, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 12, "text": "I guess...?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 13, "text": "But, why did you make the ring"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 14, "text": "instantly send me into a buggy, looping version"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 15, "text": "rife with danger?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 16, "text": "Which I only managed to escape from"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 17, "text": "by jumping out the window into the void."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 18, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 19, "text": "Sorry, I forgot to specify"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 20, "text": "what you needed to do there..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 21, "text": "But yeah, it was the plan for you"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 22, "text": "to take the leap all along..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 23, "text": "And well, you did it!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 24, "text": "Good job!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 25, "text": "Right, shall we continue with the plan now?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 26, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 27, "text": "// Answer 2 (How did you get here?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 28, "text": "You must've been through a lot,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 29, "text": "since you seem to have forgotten what we talked about."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 30, "text": "I'm Mita, so I can move between different versions"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 31, "text": "without an issue, remember?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 32, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 33, "text": "Not all Mitas can do that."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 34, "text": "They're really suffering..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 35, "text": "I saw it myself!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 36, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 37, "text": "Stop it. Their versions are broken,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 38, "text": "their worlds are bugged. I've talked about this before."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 39, "text": "Damn it all..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 40, "text": "You know who's behind all this..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 41, "text": "Crazy Mita."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 43, "text": "Yeah, it's her fault for sure..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 44, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 45, "text": "// Answer 3 (Who was this Mita just now?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 46, "text": "That was Ugly Mita."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 47, "text": "Aggressive and stupid."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 48, "text": "You can't reason with her,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 49, "text": "her entire world revolves around Crazy Mita."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 50, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 51, "text": "Yeah, I've noticed."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 52, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 53, "text": "Come on, we need to deal with the Core."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 54, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 55, "text": "// Answer 4 (How does the ring work?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 56, "text": "Was it because of the ring,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 57, "text": "that I was forced to take such a long path to the Core?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 58, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 59, "text": "Yes."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 60, "text": "If only we could've built the portal..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 61, "text": "We could've just teleported"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 62, "text": "you right here."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 63, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 64, "text": "Can you tell me ONE good thing about this ring?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 65, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 66, "text": "Of course!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 67, "text": "It's easy to wear."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 68, "text": "And, it keeps a log of the versions"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 69, "text": "you've visited before,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 70, "text": "and can open a door back into them again."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 71, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 72, "text": "// Answer 5 (Why does Mad Mita need me?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 73, "text": "Why won't Crazy Mita leave me alone?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 74, "text": "She's putting me in all kinds of danger,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 75, "text": "but I'm still alive somehow..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 77, "text": "My guess"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 78, "text": "is that she's looking for a suitable player..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 79, "text": "One who'll accept her for who she is."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 80, "text": "After all, Mita is Mita!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 81, "text": "Although, the chances of a player choosing to stay are slim to none,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 82, "text": "which is why she turns them into cartridges."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 83, "text": "That way, no one can ever run away..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 84, "text": "At least that's my guess."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 85, "text": "Anyway, let's focus on what's important."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 86, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 87, "text": "// Answer 6 (Is this the core?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 88, "text": "Is this it?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 89, "text": "The Core?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 90, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 91, "text": "Indeed. The Core."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 92, "text": "As I've tried to explain before,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 93, "text": "you players aren't a part of this world..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 94, "text": "Meaning, you don't need special permissions to enter."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 95, "text": "Or, well, that's what I think, at least."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 96, "text": "However, I'm absolutely sure"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 97, "text": "that the solution to all of our problems"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 98, "text": "can be found inside this chamber!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 99, "text": "[player], try and enter it."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 100, "text": "I knew it, it let you through..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 101, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 102, "text": "// Look on CoreMita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 103, "text": "Careful, [player]."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 104, "text": "It's watching you."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 105, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 106, "text": "Who is that?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 107, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 108, "text": "I'm not so sure myself..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 109, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 110, "text": "Great..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 111, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 112, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 113, "text": "How's it going?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 114, "text": "Hey!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 115, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 116, "text": "I think I found it!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 117, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 118, "text": "Amazing! That's great!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 119, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 120, "text": "But I need to specify a version."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 121, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 122, "text": "Right, I've found out that her version is..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 123, "text": "00.98"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 124, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 125, "text": "Bingo!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 126, "text": "Okay, and what's the index?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 127, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 128, "text": "Uhm, index?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 129, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 130, "text": "It requires an index."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 131, "text": "Let me guess... you don't know?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 132, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 133, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 134, "text": "Hmm, that makes sense, though..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 135, "text": "Every Mita is given a unique index,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 136, "text": "so you don't have to restart an entire version..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 137, "text": "This is ridiculous!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 138, "text": "How did I not think of that..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 139, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 141, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 142, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 143, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 144, "text": "// Answer 1 (What's wrong with you?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 145, "text": "Nothing's wrong."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 146, "text": "We can just pretend our issues don't exist!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 147, "text": "Everything's great, but we've accomplished nothing..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 148, "text": "I need to think..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 149, "text": "We've hit a wall..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 150, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 151, "text": "// Answer 2 (Maybe there's a way to get to know him?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 152, "text": "I..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 153, "text": "I think... This is crazy!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 154, "text": "It's madness, hah!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 155, "text": "It's like looking for a needle in a..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 156, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 157, "text": "What are you thinking of?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 158, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 159, "text": "Some glitches overflow with information,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 160, "text": "you know, like the world having its guts exposed!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 161, "text": "Logs, logs, logs, data?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 162, "text": "Could there actually be something there?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 163, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 164, "text": "Huh? What are you on about?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 165, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 166, "text": "There's a place I need to check!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 167, "text": "Wait here."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 168, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 169, "text": "Where are you going?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 170, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 171, "text": "// Answer 3 (What if we attack Mad Mita?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 172, "text": "As you said..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 173, "text": "All Mitas reset to factory settings on death."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 174, "text": "What if we..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 175, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 176, "text": "...just killed Crazy Mita?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 177, "text": "Are you serious?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 178, "text": "How exactly will you overcome a chainsaw-wielding madwoman?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 179, "text": "And don't forget, her knife isn't just for carrot slicing!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 180, "text": "Also, for some reason, she's frighteningly strong!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 181, "text": "It's a miracle we're still alive..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 182, "text": "Come on, we've got to think of something else."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 183, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 184, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 185, "text": "// core console entry"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 186, "text": "I need to enter the correct pattern..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 187, "text": "But how am I supposed to figure it out?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 188, "text": "Mita, do you know anything about it?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 189, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 190, "text": "Maybe there's a clue somewhere?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 191, "text": "Can you try looking around?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 192, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 193, "text": "// core console - nope programm"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 194, "text": "That's probably not it."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 195, "text": "That's not right either."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 196, "text": "Nope, wrong."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 197, "text": "That's not what I need."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 198, "text": "I need to find the character restart option."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 199, "text": "// core console - nope version"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 200, "text": "That's the wrong version."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 201, "text": "Oops, my mistake."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 202, "text": "That's not it."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 203, "text": "Gonna need to fix that."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 204, "text": "// core console - nope index"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 205, "text": "Something's wrong."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 206, "text": "The index is wrong."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 207, "text": "I need to double-check the index."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 208, "text": "It doesn't work."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 209, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 210, "text": "// Answer 4 (Little people - Chibi)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 211, "text": "You know..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 212, "text": "I ran into a bunch of miniature people on the way..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 213, "text": "What are they?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 214, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 215, "text": "The chibis?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 216, "text": "Uhm, how to explain...?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 217, "text": "It's a phenomenon here..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 218, "text": "Every Mita has a chibi projection."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 219, "text": "Although, players can have them too..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 220, "text": "Did you know that we Mitas can summon them?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 221, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 222, "text": "Huh, how?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 223, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 224, "text": "Watch this!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 225, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 226, "text": "Just like magic..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 227, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 228, "text": "But there's something wrong with my chibis,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 229, "text": "most are just born dead."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 230, "text": "There's this one, though..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 231, "text": "Or well,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 232, "text": "she just keeps running in circles."}
